flowchart TD
    Shell[AppShell<br/>IndexedStack, 4 tabs]

    Shell --> Home[Home tab]
    Shell --> Learn[Learn tab]
    Shell --> Progress[Progress tab]
    Shell --> Profile[Profile tab]

    Home -->|Continue| Lesson
    Home -->|module card| ModDetail
    Home -->|See all| Learn
    Home -->|recent activity| History

    Learn -->|module card| ModDetail[ModuleDetailScreen]
    ModDetail -->|locked| LockMsg[/Shows unlock requirement<br/>from module_prerequisites/]
    ModDetail -->|lesson row| Lesson[LessonScreen<br/>steps carousel]

    Lesson -->|each step change| Save[PATCH /api/progress<br/>last_step_index]
    Lesson -->|last step| Challenge[ChallengeScreen]
    Challenge -->|wrong| Hint[/Show hint, attempts++/] --> Challenge
    Challenge -->|correct| Complete[POST /api/lessons/id/complete]

    Complete --> Reward{outcome?}
    Reward -->|leveledUp| LevelUp[LevelUpScreen] --> BadgeCheck
    Reward -->|no level change| BadgeCheck{newBadges?}
    BadgeCheck -->|yes| Badge[BadgeAwardScreen] --> Result
    BadgeCheck -->|no| Result[ResultScreen]
    Result -->|Next lesson| Lesson
    Result -->|Done| Shell

    Progress --> History[HistoryScreen]
    Profile --> Edit[EditProfileScreen] --> PatchMe[PATCH /api/me]
    Profile --> History
    Profile --> Settings[SettingsScreen]

    Settings --> Prefs[PATCH /api/preferences<br/>theme, locale, reminders]
    Settings --> Out[Sign out<br/>Firebase signOut + clear token] --> Welcome([WelcomeScreen])
    Settings --> Delete[Delete account<br/>Laravel soft-delete + Firebase deleteUser] --> Welcome

    Complete -.->|offline| Queue[(sync_queue_events<br/>local, flush on reconnect)]
    Save -.->|offline| Queue
